    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. So the total amount lost over the life of the machine is $40,000, right? If I wanted to show the accumulated depreciation on the balance sheet after, say, 3 years, how would I calculate that? Just want to make sure I'm not missing any steps.",
